{"4396590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Werewolf: The Gloaming Malice", "steam_appid": 4396590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Werewolf: The Gloaming Malice</strong>, you aren't just a witness—you’re the Hunter. Scour the fortress for gear, interacting with villagers for clues, and unmask the hidden werewolves. Every night is a battle for survival, trust no one, uncover the lies, and kill the wolves before they take over the fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/c82711511970594083e7c74ac6f94c42.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1560 height=1035 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things you should always bear in mind in the Shadow Fortress:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Communication is Key!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best way to know what is happening in the Shadow Fortress is by communication. Villagers may see or hear something you did not…Kindness will reward you, just remember… you should trust no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/e22f9e3fb907e2350359b42419ca25c9.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/e22f9e3fb907e2350359b42419ca25c9.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/e22f9e3fb907e2350359b42419ca25c9.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pay Attention to Details</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most vital secrets are often buried in the dark. Use Search Mode to sharpen your senses and uncover what others miss. Keep your eyes open —missing a detail could cause disastrous outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/ed5b5eb87eb8d939b8c68a38e3d019c8.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/ed5b5eb87eb8d939b8c68a38e3d019c8.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/ed5b5eb87eb8d939b8c68a38e3d019c8.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect items and solve the puzzle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t just listen—investigate. Collect, Analyze, and Link. Every item you scavenge and every puzzle you solve shifts the power dynamic. Luck only is not enough to keep you alive, your ability to unravel the truth matters the most.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/44ac0af702e8702c58da5e0214104a32.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/44ac0af702e8702c58da5e0214104a32.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/44ac0af702e8702c58da5e0214104a32.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes raw materials alone will not save you. You need to shape and refine it. Only through careful crafting can one forge those materials into something greater and reveal the biggest lie in the fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/bfc20efd35dd521c7ec6159c55ed949f.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/bfc20efd35dd521c7ec6159c55ed949f.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/bfc20efd35dd521c7ec6159c55ed949f.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Final Strike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you raise your sword towards a wolf, a Sword Duel is inevitable. There is no return-you either win or die. Gather your evidence, sharpen your steel, and ensure your accusations are backed by proof, and most importantly… think twice before you act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/5f1b03d67f60549ace682824aceb3f15.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/5f1b03d67f60549ace682824aceb3f15.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/5f1b03d67f60549ace682824aceb3f15.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second is known as the Final Volley: a single, perfectly timed shot of silver—miss the moment, and the werewolf vanishes into the dark, beyond your reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/111a3c7f4f997934d03cdc26aa3cbd16.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/111a3c7f4f997934d03cdc26aa3cbd16.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/111a3c7f4f997934d03cdc26aa3cbd16.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Social Deduction:</strong> A visual novel where your choices and items change the outcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate and Search:</strong> Explore the rooms and look for clues to aid your hunt.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action-Oriented Mystery:</strong> Don't just talk—act. Use the items you find to change the fate of the villagers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror:</strong> Experience a haunting story where the &quot;Gloaming Malice&quot; lurks in every shadow… watch your steps to keep yourself safe</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Werewolf: The Gloaming Malice</strong>, you aren't just a witness—you’re the Hunter. Scour the fortress for gear, interacting with villagers for clues, and unmask the hidden werewolves. Every night is a battle for survival, trust no one, uncover the lies, and kill the wolves before they take over the fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/c82711511970594083e7c74ac6f94c42.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1560 height=1035 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Things you should always bear in mind in the Shadow Fortress:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Communication is Key!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best way to know what is happening in the Shadow Fortress is by communication. Villagers may see or hear something you did not…Kindness will reward you, just remember… you should trust no one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/e22f9e3fb907e2350359b42419ca25c9.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/e22f9e3fb907e2350359b42419ca25c9.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/e22f9e3fb907e2350359b42419ca25c9.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pay Attention to Details</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most vital secrets are often buried in the dark. Use Search Mode to sharpen your senses and uncover what others miss. Keep your eyes open —missing a detail could cause disastrous outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/ed5b5eb87eb8d939b8c68a38e3d019c8.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/ed5b5eb87eb8d939b8c68a38e3d019c8.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/ed5b5eb87eb8d939b8c68a38e3d019c8.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect items and solve the puzzle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t just listen—investigate. Collect, Analyze, and Link. Every item you scavenge and every puzzle you solve shifts the power dynamic. Luck only is not enough to keep you alive, your ability to unravel the truth matters the most.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/44ac0af702e8702c58da5e0214104a32.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/44ac0af702e8702c58da5e0214104a32.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/44ac0af702e8702c58da5e0214104a32.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Craft items</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes raw materials alone will not save you. You need to shape and refine it. Only through careful crafting can one forge those materials into something greater and reveal the biggest lie in the fortress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/bfc20efd35dd521c7ec6159c55ed949f.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/bfc20efd35dd521c7ec6159c55ed949f.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/bfc20efd35dd521c7ec6159c55ed949f.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Final Strike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you raise your sword towards a wolf, a Sword Duel is inevitable. There is no return-you either win or die. Gather your evidence, sharpen your steel, and ensure your accusations are backed by proof, and most importantly… think twice before you act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/5f1b03d67f60549ace682824aceb3f15.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/5f1b03d67f60549ace682824aceb3f15.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/5f1b03d67f60549ace682824aceb3f15.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second is known as the Final Volley: a single, perfectly timed shot of silver—miss the moment, and the werewolf vanishes into the dark, beyond your reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/111a3c7f4f997934d03cdc26aa3cbd16.poster.avif?t=1785319644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/111a3c7f4f997934d03cdc26aa3cbd16.webm?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4396590/extras/111a3c7f4f997934d03cdc26aa3cbd16.mp4?t=1785319644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >